  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatFamilyAndFriends.SoundsNiceYetNot": "[pg]That sounds nice enough... Curious that Sheila doesn't seem to think so."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatFamilyAndFriends.SquirmsArmWaist": "[pg]The woman squirms as you slip a hand around her waist. [say: Dammit, [name]... What do you want me to say? That I'd spend all bloody day hiding in the tall grass with you if I didn't have work to do? I'd think that would be obvious by the way I put up with your crap, you bastard.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatFamilyAndFriends.StaresObtuselyDeflect": "[say: Them? They're doing fine.] Sheila stares at you obtusely, trying to will you into changing the subject; you stare right back. She sighs. [say: No go, huh?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatFamilyAndFriends.TellHattieSureWill": "[pg]You tell \"Hattie\" that you'll be sure to."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatFamilyAndFriends.TrueButUnanswered": "[pg]True as that may be, she didn't answer the question; you draw closer, raising an eyebrow."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatFamilyAndFriends.WorkBuddiesUpgraded": "[pg][say: Guess you'd call them work buddies. I'm the girl in the group, so eventually I got upgraded from 'the sheila' to just 'Sheila'. Like I said... wankers. They're mostly blokes who glued themselves to me when they heard who my mum was, probably hoping I'd take after her eventually. Too bad for them, I always wanted to be like my dad instead.] She grins wickedly."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.AskGrowUpTime": " so well... You ask how long it takes them to grow up."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.AskWhyCant": "[pg]You ask why she can't, seeing as it's pretty clear by now you're not some kind of monster."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.AttemptDemurWavedOff": "[pg][say: That's-] you begin, attempting to demur, but she waves your comment off."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.BodypillowClause": " and clutching the life-sized [name] bodypillow I made"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.CantLeaveColony": "[pg][say: God, that'd be nice. But I can't take them out of the colony until they're ready to train a trade; those are the rules. Only nurses can, when they need to teach a class basic stuff - up is up, rocks are rocks, that sort - and they get a soldier detail when they go. I wouldn't want to anyway... Nothing on you, but there are only two of us and {0} of them. I wish I could bring you in, though.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.CaptainsDontEncourage": "[pg]Sheila nods. [say: Most of the captains don't encourage it because there aren't enough hours in the day to learn a trade right and raise your child, but when you're young and horny... those joeys typically get left with the crèche, and adopted by one of the nurses. My mum has one right now, I think. Heartbreaking for the girl who makes it.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.CatchingEnoughGame": "[pg][say: Does that happen a lot?] you probe. [say: Not catching enough game?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.DaddysGirlFirstChild": "[pg]Sheila sighs. [say: I'm a daddy's girl. His first child, got all the benefits of his time, and one without kids and a husband of her own to pull her emotions away from him. I've always just been his baby... Maybe longer than I should have, but I was lonely, mate. We're close.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.DontAskExplainPolicy": "[pg]Your companion looks profoundly unhappy. [saystart]Don't ask me to explain a policy I hate. I'd like nothing more than to fall asleep at night in an actual bed with you instead of staying up alone, worrying if you'll be alright"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.DontKillMessenger": "[pg][say: Don't kill the messenger,] you tease, slipping your arm around her waist. She shivers but doesn't resist, allowing you to play your fingers along her shirt hem until she gets up to leave."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.DowncastSmileFine": "[pg]Sheila smiles under her downcast eyes. [say: They're fine, love. Some are getting pretty big.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.EerilyBitter": "[pg]That's... eerily bitter."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.ElaboratesMeasurement": "[pg]She holds her hands eight or ten inches apart. When your eyebrows register surprise at that, she elaborates. [say: Remember how small they come out, though... Only about four inches when they're born. We tuck them in little pouches to keep them warm and up against the teat.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.EyesHardenMumVolunteered": "[pg]Sheila's eyes harden. [say: Yeah... My mum has volunteered. A few of my neighbors tried to as well, but my mum quietly chased those off, saying she'd be happy to handle it and keep it in family.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.FourInchesFigure": "[pg]Four inches? That explains how she keeps her slim figure"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.GirlyBoysBears": "[pg][say: Into girly boys instead of big, strong, hairy bears?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.GoodOilDrooling": "[pg][say: Thanks. That's good oil.] It doesn't take long before she's completely out, drooling on you with abandon; after the promised hour, you gently tap her awake."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.HandInYours": "[pg][say: I'm not fishing, mate... Don't worry about it. I wouldn't trade you or a single one of your kids for all the beauty of the assembled succubus corps.] She slips her hand into yours. [say: Not even the little hellion.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.HideLaughterSmock": "[pg]You nod, trying to hide your laughter at the mental image of her dad in a pink gardening smock with a spade in hand and two bags of root vegetables on his shoulders. Sheila looks at your barely-concealed grin, and pokes you in the side. [say: Something funny, mate?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.HollowLinedFace": "[pg]Sheila turns a hollow, lined face on you. [say: You tell me, mate.] Looking into it, you can clearly see the stress your numerous broodlings have already etched into her skin. The youth is gone from her; naivete has been replaced with the mien of an experienced mother, even though her body looks nearly the same. You bite your lip."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.HowAreTheKids": "[say: So how are the kids?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.ImplicationsAskAge": "[pg]The implications come to you in a hurry, and you ask how old she is. Five years? Ten?"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.KidsAllRightAgain": "[say: Kids doing all right?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.KnowsFromExperience": "[pg]You ask if she knows from experience, looking at her cautiously."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.LadysAgeSayEnd": " lady's age, after all.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.LaughsWontTellAge": "[pg]Sheila laughs. [say: No, mate; much older than that. I'm not going to tell you how much, though.] Her eyes narrow in mock suspicion, and she smiles broadly. [saystart]A {0} doesn't ask a"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.LeanUntilSheLeaves": "[pg]Shaking your head, you lean against her; the two of you remain like that until she gets up to leave and bids you farewell."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.LesbianClamDiver": "[sayend][pg][say: A lesbian? Attracted to women? A clam diver?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.LoveYouSoon": "[pg]Sheila sighs and gets up, nodding to you, and collects her stuff. [say: Love you. See you soon.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.MeetsGazeMumNurse": "[pg][say: What? No...] Sheila meets your gaze. [say: I just see it too often because of who my mum is. A poor young thing crying at our door in the small hours, begging to hold her baby just a bit longer, as Mum and Dad try to console her and get her to go home and sleep so she's not easy prey for some rapist wildlife the next day. Can't be too careful when you get pregnant like falling downhill.] She squeezes your hand and rests her forehead against your shoulder. [say: Yours was my first, mate.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.NotOftenBiscuits": "[pg][say: No... not often. Not all hunters hunt game - most of the new salamander biscuits are just sent out with a flyer and told to pick wild fruits and vegetables. I get to set traps and take naps instead of trudging around with heavy baskets, digging in the dirt for ten hours, but it's only because we have few enough cobbers who are good at getting meat. Food purification is also part of the hunting job for those with chemist's training, but the reservists inside the colony help a lot with that. So you could see him a week from now, or you could live and die and never meet him - it all depends on who the next person that can't do their work anymore is.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.NotRightNow": ". But it's not going to happen right now.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.NotherWord": "nother"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.NurseryCronesConstant": "[pg][say: The kids already spend all day in the nursery listening to her and her crones - just a constant flow of pork about how 'women's work' is in the home and girls like me are wrong to be outside and away from them. Of course she never says it in so many words, but kids pick up what they see. I don't want mine going home with her at night to get the private lesson just because I was too lazy to fetch them. I can hear her now... 'Your mum is all tired out from working at her job and needs to rest before she sees you, so you just come home with me and Nana will take care of you.' Pig's arse.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.OfferWatchThem": " You pat her shoulder carefully and suggest, [say: I could watch them for a while.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.OwnKidAtFour": "[pg][say: So you could really do that?] you ask, changing tack. [say: Have your own kid when you're only four?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.PrettyFaceReaction": "I don't know how he'll react when he sees a pretty face like yours, though; he doesn't know that I'm-"
