  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.ReadsExpressionHopes": "[pg]Sheila looks into your eyes, trying to read your expression. [say: Yeah, I think so. I hope he's not set to bail you up, but... he says he aims to search you out when he gets switched back to the hunting crew.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.RepeatHowKidDoing": "[pg][say: I said, 'how's the kid doing?',] you repeat."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.RetortTickleEar": "[pg][say: But I'm no {0},] you retort, leaning in to tickle her ear with your words. [say: Though, I was only asking because your skin is so smooth and your nipples so perky...] You nip at her lobe. [say: And your pussy still squeezes like it's your first time.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.RubCheekApology": "[pg]You grin, rubbing your cheek. The woman blushes and her ears slump; she looks away and mumbles, [say: Sorry... Didn't mean to swat you. You surprised me, that's all.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SeeItReflections": "[pg][say: I know; you don't even have to say it,] Sheila mumbles. [say: I can see it in reflections. I'm not even pretty anymore.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SeriousAboutMeeting": "[pg][say: So, is he serious... about meeting?] you persist carefully."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SeriousAboutThis": "[pg][say: You really are serious about this, aren't you?] Sheila mumbles. You nod, and she continues. [saystart]You remind me of my dad... Once I brought the joey home and told him about us, he was in the nursery to check on it all the time. He says he wants to meet the man who was able to father such a healthy baby with his little girl - "
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.ShakeHandOrPunch": "I'm not sure if he intends to shake your hand or punch you, though.[sayend]"
