  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.ShrieksSlapsRootRat": "[pg][say: [name]!] Sheila shrieks, pulling back and slapping you across the face. [say: You nasty root rat!]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.ShrugDependsQuota": "[pg][say: I dunno, mate,] she says, shrugging her shoulder against your arm. [say: It all depends on what the colony needs. If we lose hunters or can't bring in enough food, we pull members of other teams and the reserve in to make up the slack - whoever's rated for the job. Otherwise it'll be when his rotation comes up, assuming we don't lose soldiers or diggers first.]"
