  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SoQuestion": "[pg][say: So...?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SomeoneElseWatch": "[pg][say: Don't you have someone else that can watch them for you?] you ask."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SoonQuestion": "[pg][say: Will that be soon, then?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.SoundsProtective": "[pg][say: Sounds... protective.]"
