  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.TooBadArmAround": "[pg]That's too bad. You slip an arm around her comfortingly, and she snuggles up to you. [say: If you need to sleep a bit,] you offer, [say: I can watch you for an hour.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.TrustYouNeverChange": "[pg][say: [name], trust you to never change. Do... you really want to make love?] Her care-worn eyes look into yours, regaining a bit of their former enthusiasm, and her skin heats up under your fingers."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.TwoYearsPurebred": "[pg][say: Well,] Sheila says, [say: I dunno about yours, but two years or so is enough for purebred kids to be up and helping around the colony - they're about three or four feet then. Just basic stuff, like carrying small bags of food home from the storage for their mum or dad. Two more years and they're basically adults... not as wise as one, of course, but they start perving and pairing off around then, no matter how much their oldies urge them not to. Magic of hormones, world's your oyster, and all that.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.WhisperTurnedOn": "[pg][say: I'm still turned on by you,] you persist with a whisper. [say: I want your body any time, anywhere. Here, for example. Or... here.] This last comment is accompanied by your hand sliding into her shirt and over a {0} breast. Sheila blushes."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKids.WrapsArmSurprised": "[pg][say: I heard you, mate... I was just a little surprised.] Sheila wraps her arm around yours. [say: The baby's fine. Eats well and loves attention. The other day I stuck my finger into that chubby little hand and it closed around me and wouldn't let go... I sat there for about an hour, just watching and sighing. Sometimes it feels like I'm turning into one of those mush-headed new moms that always embarrassed me before, though.] She looks at you with a half-smile."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKidsRest4Now.AlwaysDrawHand": "[say: Always,] you answer, [say: but if you need to relax and sleep for a bit, I'm here for that too.] You draw your hand back out, patting her on the cheek."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKidsRest4Now.BackWord": "back"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKidsRest4Now.DozesNudgeAwake": "[pg]You nod and she dozes off; her face looks much more placid in sleep. After an hour you gently nudge her awake, and she picks herself up and leaves you with a hug. [say: Love you, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKidsRest4Now.KissForeheadLays": "[pg]Sheila kisses you on the forehead and then lays her head against your "
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKidsRest4Now.LapWord": "lap"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatKidsRest4Now.SweetTakeUpOffers": ". [say: You're sweet... Thank you. I will take you up on both of those offers - but maybe just the nap this arvo. Would you wake me up in about an hour?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatLiveWithMe.AskMoveInCamp": "You ask Sheila to move in with you at your camp, and she turns bright red."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatLiveWithMe.FeetWistfulCatch": "[pg]Sheila gets to her feet and balances her catch on her shoulders, looking wistful. When you ask about it, however, she just shakes her head and tells you it's nothing, then walks off subdued. Seems like she really wanted to say 'yes', instead."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatLiveWithMe.HardlyKnowYou": "[pg][say: Mate, I hardly know you. I mean... um, I suppose I don't get to use that excuse when I feel what you're feeling if we... uh. No. The answer is no.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatLiveWithMe.RelentsDifferentWorld": "[pg]Upon seeing your disappointment, she relents a bit. [say: If it were a different world, one without demons, then maybe; once we'd known each other a while longer. But here and now? I can't reconcile leaving my mob behind when we need every cobber available to help guard and feed us. I do like you... Don't let it go to your head, though.] She places her hand over yours and kisses you on the cheek. [say: Thank you for asking.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.BonzerMeansGreat": "[pg]The woman colors a bit and looks down. [say: Er...] she mumbles, [say: it means you're great, [name]. Top shelf. My favorite {0}.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.BoomerAssumption": "[pg]She lowers her eyelids at you. [say: That's a boomer of an assumption. And, it's not like you can do anything special even if you know, mate. What I am is what I am. It doesn't really matter anyway, since I'll be getting closer to </i>your<i> personality if... well.] Sheila looks at you coquettishly."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.BrightRedNo": "[pg]Sheila blushes bright red. [say: No.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.CouplesSoundingAlike": "[pg][say: Does that actually happen? Couples sounding alike?] Privately, you can't even imagine understanding, let alone using, half the words she does."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.DefensivePushesTits": " - though it's probably meant to be a defensive gesture, all it does is push her tits together under her white shirt and frame them in light-brown skin"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.DistraughtLogicalConclusion": "[pg]Sheila seems increasingly distraught as she considers that logical conclusion. [say: N-no... I don't wanna!] she finally blurts childishly, dropping her posture and throwing her arms around you. [say: I don't want to let you go, and I don't want to have to hide in the ground while you're out here in danger; I want to stay with you! I wish the demons would all just go to hell so I could have a proper life!] She remains like that for several minutes, face pressed against you until her sniffling and shaking stop"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.DontTeaseDriveCrazy": "[pg][say: Don't tease me so much,] she says, pulling your arm around her. [say: You drive me crazy.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.DontWantToTalk": "[say: [name], I don't want to talk about that,] Sheila says, [say: it leaves a bad taste in my mouth.]"
