  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.FrownsPlaysWithHand": "[pg]Sheila frowns unhappily and doesn't answer... but she does play with your hand, articulating the fingers and rubbing it against her warm cheek until it's time for her to go."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.GetUsedToIt": "[pg][say: You'll get used to it.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.HandOnShoulder": "; you lay a hand on her shoulder reassuringly"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.InheritedPersonalityPoint": "[pg]Changing tack, you point out that Sheila would have inherited some personality from them, thanks to her... situational empathy... so it's only fair if you know a little bit, right?"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.JustProposedQuestion": "[pg][say: Did you just propose to me?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.LooksAwayFoldsArms": "[pg]The woman looks away and folds her arms over her chest"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.MeansStoppingSeeing": "[pg]A bit unnerved, you ask if she really means that - if she intends to stop seeing you because your relationship will be a difficult one if the demons aren't defeated."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.NotGonnaMarryYou": ". [say: [name], you horny whacker, I'm not gonna marry you. Having to bull my way through a horde of monsters to see you and stand watch in shifts just to sleep together at night may be romantic once, but it's no kind of thing to do every day for the rest of my life.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.OfferOwnHistoryRefused": "[pg]You offer to tell her about your own history, as an enticement, but she shakes her head. [say: I don't want to talk about that either! Look, no matter how cosmopolitan, nobody really wants to hear about the dicks [his] girl's had growing out of her face. I mean, how many is the right answer?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.OhIsThatSo": "[pg][say: Oh. Is that so?] you ask, facetiously."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.PullsAwayNoseRed": ". Eventually she pulls away again, nose slightly red. [say: Sorry, mate; didn't mean to have a tantrum on you.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.RichGirlTalk": "[pg][say: It does... My mum used to talk like a rich girl. Still did, when I was coming up. But after being with my dad for so long and so... often, they're pretty much the same person now, no matter how much I separate them in my head. It's not that the words bleed over, just that they stop sounding wrong to you. I already catch myself thinking of what you might call a thing once in a while and have to correct it before I say it to one of my mates - it might just be because I think you're bonzer, though.] Sheila grins toothily, pressing your hand."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.SoonTenYears": "[pg][say: Well you should soon, if you want to get started on those ten years.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.StickItOutQuestion": "[pg][say: Going to stick it out, then?] you ask, carefully."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.StiflesLaughNotFunny": "[pg]The woman stifles a laugh. [say: [name], that's not funny. I... guess I would, though it'll take a while since I feel so strongly. Deadset, there's not much to know; I promise. Ask again after we've been together so much we have the same accent - after ten years of happy marriage, maybe.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatOldLoves.WhatBonzerMeans": "[pg]Like that... What does 'bonzer' even mean?"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatWhyHide.DesertCityBustling": " After all, the city in the desert seems to be bustling and bristling with weapons to resist the demons, whatever her feelings may be about it."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.FuckBuddySheilaMeetingChatWhyHide.EyesCloudDubious": "Her eyes cloud as she looks at you dubiously. [say: Well, it's like I said before. If a demon catches one of us, we're done for. You know, I'm sure, that when a demon manages to get a mug to want pleasure more than anything and turn into a demon as well, they get a free souvenir in the form of those little crystals that grant them powers. Imagine how many of those arses would love to find a hundred or so of us in one place, just lacking some stimulation to turn us into a birthday party and a pile of free godlike power trinkets. That'd be all of them, y'see.]"
