  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDED.ProffersSnackBreathes": "[pg]As you sit, she proffers the snack, smiling, then closes her eyes. The woman breathes deeply and regularly as you pick and eat a morsel from her gift. Just as you wonder if you should wake her, she speaks. [saystart][name]... I, ah... made another addition to your posterity. Came out "
