  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDED.WeakNearlyLostIt": "weak... We thought we were going to lose it for a bit. It wouldn't drink from the nurse unless I was there, so I had to stay up with it all night myself. Feeling a bit stuffed.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.AsksSureLowers": "[pg][say: This... uh, are you sure?] she asks. Sighing, you lower yourself slightly, to make the leg up a bit easier. She rests her arm on your back, then bends herself and hops atop you easily, sliding one foot over. One of her hands grabs at your torso to keep the tired woman from falling right off the other side, and the other joins it once she steadies herself. She takes her hat off again and hangs it around your neck, then mumbles, [say: Okay... I'm ready.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.BlanklyTakesHandMeander": "[pg]Sheila looks at you blankly, but takes your hand and begins walking. Or rather, more like meandering. Her head turns listlessly as she drags you onward."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.CirclesDustRetort": "[pg][say: Pretty good for old [name], making circles in the dust,] she retorts, shoulders hunched under the weight of so many animals. [say: I might even get to sleep in tomorrow with this much.] She wraps her arms around you in a hug, then looks in your eyes."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.ConfusedGlumNod": "[pg]Sheila looks a little confused, but glumly nods. [say: Alright, [name]; we'll do it your way.] She begins to walk, then turns back when you don't follow. [say: Are you com-]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.CoyArrowsImpressive": "[pg][say: Wow, [name],] she says, coyly handing you back your arrows. [say: That was impressive - like having my own guardian angel. I've got more than enough to take home now, so do you want to... do anything else together?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.DoNormallyHelp": "[pg][say: Just do what you normally do, and I'll help.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.DoNormallyThinkSomething": "[pg][say: Just do what you normally do and I'll think of something.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.DullAmberClimbOn": "[pg]You look into her dull amber eyes for a minute to nerve yourself, and then speak. [say: Climb on.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.FatiguedBrainFlirting": "[pg]It takes a minute for your fatigued brain to come around to the fact that she's actually flirting with you! Dumbly you look back at her, trying to make your exhaustion apparent in your eyes so you won't have to speak."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.FlinchesWarmSafe": "[pg]She flinches. [say: I didn't mean to fall asleep, but you were warm and... I felt safe.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.FlushHoursBanter": "[pg]You flush game like this for several hours, bantering with your increasingly-companionable companion between exertions; she seems to lose track of both time and her irritation, evolving from moping and staring at the ground to blushing and staring at you. Eventually she's caught enough to take back, though, and you have to receive her thanks and bid her farewell."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.GlideClause": "glide"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.GlideTowardAnimals": "[pg]This is more than enough surprise for you, though. Staring down the animals, you begin to glide slowly toward them. Sheila tries to grab your hand again, but you're already past her, closing in on the birds even as their bodies relax. You stop around fifteen yards away, and begin undulating your body, shaping patterns even as you hold their eyes with your own. Your coils shift to circles, then squares, then oozy triangles, over and over, as you compel the prey with your stare. Unable to stir hand or foot without your permission, the animals come forward as you beckon until they're sitting in front of you."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.GoThatWayStill": "[pg][say: Go that way and keep still... lay a trap or something,] you interrupt, pointing at a perpendicular to the hare's path."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.GodDammitBold": "[pg]<b>[say: Oh, god dammit.]</b>"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.GruntsDroolLine": "[pg][say: Uh!] she grunts, picking her head up slowly. A line of drool connects her mouth to your back, and you peer over your shoulder at her for several seconds until she re-registers where she is and her eyes widen. [say: Shit! Sorry!]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.GruntsSobersRustling": "[pg]Sheila simply grunts at that, but sobers up a bit. You walk together a bit longer until a rustling in the grass startles you both; a hare breaks from cover and bolts away, and your companion swears an oath at missing quarry so close to hand."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.HatOnTuckLunch": "You pick up her forgotten hat and set it on her head, then fold her lunch back into its grass wrapper and tuck it into her pack."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.InsistIntoEar": "[pg][say: Let me help you,] you insist quietly, into her ear."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.LongLoopDriveCloser": ", making a long loop around to the rear of the wary animal, then begin to systematically drive it closer to your partner, who has strung a line to the base of a shrub and is gesturing at you to force the hare into it."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.MumblesSpoorKills": "[pg]Sheila starts, then mumbles out her answer. [say: Uh. Whatever's useful - spoor, live animals, fresh kills... a quiet place to curl up and die...]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.MuzzyStareTurnsRed": "[pg]Sheila stares muzzily as you jerk a thumb toward your equine half, slowly turning red as your intention penetrates her sleep-deprived psyche."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.NoUseMoping": "[pg]No use in her moping like that; "
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.NodFlyShootSorry": "[pg][say: Oh... oh! Right, sorry. I wasn't even thinking about that, mate. It must be hard to fly and shoot at the same time.] You nod gratefully, and she wraps her arms around your neck. [say: Offer's on the table if you want it later, though.] She kisses you on the lips, then releases you and walks away slowly, swaying her hips and peering over her shoulder for your benefit. Seems like archery hits her mark?"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.NodsTakesHandSlither": "[pg]Sheila nods slowly and takes your hand, pulling you forward. You slither alongside the woman for several minutes until she stops suddenly, putting a hand over your mouth before you can ask why. Following her gaze, you see what caused her to pull up short: two large pheasants sit up cautiously, eyes on Sheila and yourself as they prepare to bolt at the slightest sign of aggression. The woman next to you is already cursing under her breath at losing the element of surprise."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.NotNowFrowns": " [say: Dammit, [name]... not now,] she frowns, pulling away from you."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.PinchEarFlick": "you pinch her ear, provoking an annoyed flick from it."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.PointsPheasantFlushed": "[pg]It's not long before she points toward a small thatch of grass; at the motion of her arm a pheasant takes flight, trying to flee from her. You pull the bow, carefully aim your shot ahead of the fleeting target, and let the arrow go. Gravity takes it, making up for your shallow draw, and pins the bird to the ground on the first try, killing it instantly. Sheila wanders over to claim it. This continues for several hours, your companion chasing animals from cover and your arrows finding them more often than not. The misses you do experience give you some insight on how the slight wind plays with the trajectory, and by the time you're too tired to pull anymore, you feel like you might have gotten better. Slowly, you allow your weary wings to return you to the ground next to your companion, who is laden with game."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.PrettyFastWarmly": "[pg][say: [name], you're pretty fast,] she says, warmly."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.PreyJinksCompensate": "[pg]The prey, perhaps sensing something amiss, begins to jink away from the line. To compensate, you put on an extra burst of speed, using your facility at running to draw even with it in a sprint whenever it tries to turn away, and force it back on track. Just when it crosses the line, Sheila pulls it taut, catching the hare mid-stride and sending it tumbling; you're on it before it can recover, holding it still as your partner draws closer to deliver the killing blow."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.QueerFaceCompliesLopes": "[pg]Sheila pulls a queer face, but complies, loping off in the indicated direction. After stretching yourself, you break into an easy "
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.QuestionCutBow": "[pg]Her question cuts off when she sees you, arrow nocked on your bow, beating your wings against the ground and pushing yourself into the air. Without so much as a how-do-you do, you ascend until you're high in the sky with the sun on your quarter. Almost imperceptibly, Sheila shrugs below you and resumes walking."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.QuirkBrowTheatrical": "[pg]You quirk an eyebrow at her as she affects tiredness, yawning theatrically. [say: Oh no, [name], what are you doing? Don't hypnotize me too...] Sheila breaks the embrace and sits down, laying your catch and her pack beside her, then turns a hopeful face on you. [say: Not to be cheeky but... care to join me for a nap?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.QuitStaringGround": "[pg][say: Quit staring at the ground, then.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.RaceYouSometime": "[pg][say: Race you sometime,] you reply."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.ReadyToTrain": "[pg][say: I'm ready to train that whenever you are,] you answer coyly."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.RunClause": "run"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.SecuresCatchMoves": "[pg]The woman takes the opportunity to secure your 'catch', and the two of you move across the grasslands, quickly meeting her quota and more by working together like this. [say: Well?] you ask Sheila, once she's loaded down with game."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.SidelongFinishingQuickly": "[pg]Sheila shakes her head, then looks at you sidelong from half-closed eyes. [say: Ah... but finishing quickly isn't what matters most. You need the endurance to keep at it all day.] She smiles."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.SlapAssGrabHandful": "you slap her on the ass, grabbing a handful and taking her mind off her own misery."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.SlipsDownWipesMouth": "[pg]Sheila slips down from you quickly and wipes her mouth, then retrieves her catch. [say: Um... Really, I'm sorry,] she mumbles, fastening it to the bundle. She rests her hand on your flank for a moment, then begins unloading you. [say: This is more than enough. Thanks. I'll be alright now...]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.SupplyFinishingSentence": "[pg][say: ...Now that you've had a nap?] you supply, finishing her sentence."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.TouchRousesTrance": "[pg]A touch on your shoulder almost rouses you from your trance. Sheila, beside you and beside herself with incredulity, speaks in a whisper. [say: That's... it's almost like cheating, mate.] You barely resist the urge to answer with a cliché smirk."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.TrotLeansTorpidly": "[pg]You break into a trot, and Sheila leans her head against you, torpidly flicking her ears as she looks to one side or the other. Occasionally she pats your side to get your attention, calling out a spot where she'd like to dismount and set up a trap, but for the most part the ride passes in silence. You make several circuits of the plains, checking snares and adding caught animals to the bundle she slings over your back; once, you arrive at the site of a sprung trap, only to realize by the sound of Sheila's breathing that she's asleep and must have been for some time! With a tug on her hand, you rouse the woman."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.TwitchesPullsAway": "[pg]It twitches in front of your face and the woman pulls away, peering at you with curiosity from under her heavy eyelids. [say: I'm not against it, but... how are you going to?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.UncertainThenHugs": "[pg][say: Ah, thanks mate,] Sheila says. She looks uncertain for a minute, then comes to a decision and wraps her arms around you, hugging you weakly."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.VoiceStartlesSlumped": "[pg]Sheila's voice startles you, and you look over at her. The woman is slumped down on the ground, staring at the horizon, and as you look closer you can see her chest quaking as she chokes back a sob. [say: What's wrong?] you ask."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.WanderFlushGame": "[pg][say: Just wander around and flush game; point out animals you see.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.WavesOffHugsAnimals": "[pg]Waving off her embarrassment dismissively, you allow Sheila to hug you once more and hang the game animals - and hat - around her shoulders, then leave her to head back."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.WetEyesLostTime": "[pg]She turns wet eyes on you, at the verge of tears. [say: So stupid of me... I lost track of time and missed curfew... Now I can't deliver these, and I can't check on the baby! I'll have to spend all night outside, keeping myself awake, and then do all this again tomorrow!] Her composure is already breaking down in her face."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.WhatLookingFor": "[pg][say: So what are we looking for?] you ask."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOut.YetAnotherWoman": "[pg][say: Oh look,] you retort, [say: yet another woman who wants to sleep with me.] She laughs and catches your hand, pulling you down and snuggling up to you; her fatigue catches up to her quickly, and she's soon asleep with a peaceful smile on her face. You watch her for a while before you, too, fall asleep, lulled by the rays of the sun."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.AdjustToKeepContact": "[pg]You adjust yourself occasionally to keep your "
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.AffirmCozyHideout": "[pg][say: Something cozy,] you affirm."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.ApologizesAndThanks": "[pg][say: Sorry it's not as comfortable as it could be, mate,] she apologizes. [say: And... thanks.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.ArmsAroundHerWaist": " yourself, then grabs your arms and pulls them around her waist."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.ArrangeGrassNest": "[pg]It doesn't take long to arrange the grass and place yourselves inside, though there's not enough room for both of you to lie down. Sheila snuggles up to you after you "
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.AskAboutHorses": "[pg][say: You like horses, don't you?] you ask."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.AskIfCold": "[pg]She shivers against you, even with your arms around her body. [say: Cold?] you ask."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.AssentWithBroadSmile": " give assent with little more than a broad smile. Sheila pulls her shirt over her head, revealing her {0} breasts, but raises her face to you hesitantly when her hands get to her belt."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.BadMoodConfession": "[pg]Sheila frowns unhappily. [say: I know, mate... I'm just in a terrible mood lately.] She slips her hand into yours and tries to rest her head on your shoulder. [say: Don't let it diminish me in your eyes... I still think you're the bee's knees.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.BegFifteenMoreMinutes": "[pg][say: Mmm... Lemme sleep for fifteen minutes more, mate,] she mumbles."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.BlameGodsDesign": "[pg][say: Well, sorry,] you answer, almost offended. [say: Can't help the way god made me.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.BloodWord": "blood"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.BlushDeepensUndressing": "[pg]Sheila's blush deepens, but she nods and finishes undressing, pulling down her shorts and panties to expose her smooth pussy, then puts the clothing in a pile. She turns her back to you and scoots in once more, leaving a tingle that spurs you to hold her closer when her flushed, embarrassed skin touches yours. [say: This feels good,] she says, [say: like a warm bath.] Sheila giggles nervously as you instinctively pull her naked body deeper into your own. [say: H-hey, [name]. Don't swallow me, mate.] You bubble happily as you relax around her, covering most of the exposed skin below her collarbone with a thin layer of yourself."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.CannotStopRustling": "[pg]With barely any room to move, you wouldn't know how to stop them from rustling against her even if you knew where the tickle was, but take your arms from around her. [say: Slide down.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.ChitinTooHardCold": "[pg][say: Your legs are so bloody hard and cold, [name],] she clarifies brutally, tapping on the chitin digging into her back."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.CoilWord": "coil"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.ComplainAboutFeathers": "[pg][say: Sorry, mate... Your feathers are tickling me,] Sheila protests."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.DistractedByHerBody": "... or would be, if you weren't distracted by the nipples poking into you and the thighs squeezing your flank"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.EyebrowAtAssumption": "[pg]You raise an eyebrow at her assumptions, and Sheila turns her face downward, staring at the ground as her ears twitch furiously in embarrassment. Resting your head against hers seems to calm her a bit."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.FeetPokeOutCanopy": "[pg]Strapped for space, her long feet still poke a good way out of the grass canopy, and she gets back up, tucking them under her body. [say: Uh... [name], not to be forward but...] Her eyes dart toward your broad back, and you sigh and fold your legs as comfortably as you can before nodding. She giggles and climbs atop you, then spreads herself generally around."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.GooWord": "goo"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.GrudgingReposition": " She grudgingly repositions, allowing you to rest against her."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.HeadPopsBackUp": "[pg]No sooner does she get her head down than it's back up again. You look a question at her."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.HerTurnToWatch": "[pg]You rub your smarting jaw, glaring back, and tell Sheila that it's her turn to watch. Well, the adrenaline will keep her up, at least."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.LeerNearlyDerailsHer": " The leer you display is so prurient that she seems on the verge of reconsidering, but you compose yourself and"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.LovedWatchingPonies": "[pg][say: I used to love watching the ponies, growing up,] she answers, nuzzling into your shoulder. [say: I always wanted a little one.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.MentionUrgentImp": "[pg][say: I don't mind,] you whisper, [say: but this imp seems to have an urgent message for you.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.MumblesWowSnuggling": "[pg][say: [name]... wow,] she mumbles, snuggling against you and looking over her shoulder. [say: Do you cover all your girlfriends in sticky white strings?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.NodsThenRealizes": "[pg]Sheila nods and looks around for a while, moping. Suddenly, her eyes widen with wakefulness as the full import of your words hits her. [say: Um... [name], you said... us?] she asks, flushing."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.PullWomanToFeet": "With a wan smile, you pull the woman to her feet. She doesn't resist, but continues looking into your face disconsolately. [say: I'm so stonkered I can't even think what to do first...]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.RestsThenRisesAgain": "[pg]She does so, resting in your downy lap for a moment, but gets up again. You raise an eyebrow at her, but she just takes off her vest and sets it under her head, then settles, evidently at ease. This is somewhat irritating; you're basically sitting up straight, with perfect posture. A bit of an uncomfortable pose to hold for hours on end."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.RollEyesAtModesty": "[pg]You roll your eyes skyward. [say: We have kids together. I've seen it.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.RubsYourLowerHalf": "[pg]The way she rubs your lower half affectionately is even a little bit endearing"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SeatWord": "seat"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SheWrigglesTooMuch": "[pg]She shifts in your embrace, pushing up and down and giving you fits. [say: Good lord, woman, what is the matter?] you ask."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SheilaSleepsAtOnce": " flowing, unsure if you'll be able to get to sleep, but Sheila has no such problems. Within minutes, the woman is out, head nodding forward. You suppose that means the first watch is yours... It passes slowly, despite the scenery, but eventually you nudge your partner awake when you can stay up no longer."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SighsHoldItThere": ". [say: Ahh,] she sighs, shifting in your coils. [say: Hold it right there...]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SleepingFifteenMinutes": "[pg]You nearly consider it, tired as you are, until you remember that a sleeping person's fifteen minutes are two hours in the waking world and shake her again until she gets up."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SmilesThenStiffens": "[pg]Sheila smiles a bit at that, but forces her face into a stern expression. [say: Usually I like a thatch of tall grass - you can beat down or dig up the middle and pull the sides in with some string so it looks normal from the air, and you can tear out of there fast if something finds you. We'll need a big patch for two mugs... like that one,] she decides, pointing off a ways."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.NormalSheilaPregNotifREPEATEDEDHelpABitchOutANDSTAYDERE.SuggestFindingHideout": "[pg][say: Well, first is probably finding us a place to hide,] you suggest."
