  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaFriendlyComeHereOften.LikeBeingOutHere": "[pg][say: We-ell...] she begins, at length. [say: Couldn't say I enjoy it specifically. I just like bein' out from under the thumb of the village captain. Not that I disagree with his policies, y'know, except the part where he's a bloody iron-handed control freak. But other areas are basically off-limits to us anymore.]"
