  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaPologyFight.SwingDodgedWarning": "Saying nothing, you raise your [weapon] and take a swing! Sheila starts a bit and dodges just in time, then with a look of resignation, raises her fists as well. [say: That'll be right, I guess. For what it's worth, I really am sorry.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReallyMad.ForgotCatchRealize": "[pg]It doesn't take long, of course, until she realizes she's forgotten her catch; when you pick the bundle of game up and hold it out to her, Sheila trots guiltily back and stops a few paces in front."
