  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReallyMad.TaintGoesCrazy": "It's so hard to remember myself anymore, and the taint you've put in my body goes crazy when you touch me. Do you want me to get on my hands and knees?[sayend] The woman lowers herself to the ground. [saystart]I beg you. "
