  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReallyMadStandGround.ThrustFistAir": "[pg][say: So... it has to be like this, then? Alright!] Sheila thrusts a fist in the air, eyes glinting, and yells [say: Come out! 'Ready, World'!] A form flows from her, taking the shape of a slim, dark woman with curly, almost liquid hair, in a loose vest and billowing, long-sleeved tunic. Sheila jumps at you, and both the woman and her glamorous stand draw back to punch!"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcile.GrinsCatchOnQuick": "[pg][say: Heh,] she says, grinning. [say: You catch on quick, mate.] The grass rustles next to her and her hand appears, holding a bundle of several dead rabbits by their tied-together feet. [say: I have plenty of protein donors already, though. Was just lazing a bit before I decided what to do for grub, and then there you are, standing out like dog's balls.] She rubs the back of her head and looks away. [say: Well... Care to join me for tea? I guess I was a wee bit rude before, and it gives me an excuse to cook one of these beasties. BYOB, of course.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcile.PanningHorizon": "[pg]You turn around quickly, panning the horizon for the source. It doesn't take you long to pick out the head and long ears of Sheila, sitting up above the grass she must have been lying in until now. A simple wave answers her greeting, but you keep a buttoned lip, remembering the last chilly reception."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcile.VoiceBehindBackAgain": "[say: Oy, it's you,] sings out a voice behind you. [say: Back again?]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcileDunWanna.BodgyBikkieRemark": "[pg][say: Guess it's bodgy bikkie again today...]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcileDunWanna.PalmsOutDecline": "Raising your hands in a palms-out gesture, you decline. Sheila colors a bit, misinterpreting your reluctance. [say: Hey, it's not like I'm cracking onto you or anything. I was just looking for a reason to eat half a rabbit myself, is all.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcileDunWanna.PleasantriesJustBusy": "[pg]You quickly formulate some pleasantries to lessen the awkwardness, and assure her that you're just busy; she seems to calm down. As you turn away and head back to camp, you can hear her mumbling."
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcileKay.FreshMeatTempting": "Some fresh meat does sound pretty tempting. You nod at the woman and she climbs to her feet. [say: Beaut! Do me the favor and fossick about for some tinder.]"
  "Scenes.Sheilascene.SheilaReconcileKay2.BeckoningMeatClause": "the beckoning hunks of meat"
